SUMMARY:Member Mingle
LOCATION:The Sky Deck
DESCRIPTION:Category: Member Mixer\nPrice: Free / Included\nStatus: unlimit
 ed\nEvent URL: https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/186839\n\nJoin us f
 or our weekly Member Mingle as we take the gathering outdoors for the summ
 er season on The Sky Deck. Set against sweeping city views and warm summer
  sunshine\, this inclusive gathering offers the perfect opportunity to con
 nect with fellow members\, exchange ideas\, and cultivate meaningful relat
 ionships.\n\nWhether you're sparking new collaborations\, sharing insights
 \, or simply enjoying great conversation\, Member Mingle is a welcoming sp
 ace to engage with our dynamic community. Join us for an evening of connec
 tion\, inspiration\, and conversation.\n\n*This event is complimentary and
  reserved exclusively for members. Complimentary light bites will be serve
 d\, and beverages will be available for purchase. In the event of inclemen
 t weather\, the gathering will move indoors to The Living Room.
