BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:quin-event-192831@thequinhouse.com
DTSTAMP:20260707T140000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260707
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260708
SUMMARY:On the 'House: Cake & Champagne 
LOCATION:The Terrace
DESCRIPTION:Category: Holiday\nPrice: Free / Included\nStatus: unlimited\nT
 ime: 2 PM – 7 PM\nEvent URL: https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/192
 831\n\nAs The 'Quin turns five\, we invite members to stop by the Terrace\
 , for a sweet treat and a glass of champagne on the ‘House to celebrate 
 the community that we've co-created. \n\nLook forward to a welcome by the
  familiar faces of the Membership team\, and a first preview of our Summer
  Pop-Up flanking the ivy trellises featuring stunning paintings and drawin
 gs by 'Quin Co-Founder Sandy Edgerley's beloved mother and exceptional art
 ist Denise Matejic. The exhibition showcases a recognizable work that memb
 ers often admire on the Grand Staircase\, Tranquility after a Snowfall. 
 \n\nHere's to more years of meaningful connections and continuing our lega
 cy together. Thank you for being such a vital part of our extraordinary co
 mmunity!\n\n*This event is complimentary and reserved for members only.
URL:https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/192831
CATEGORIES:Holiday
END:VEVENT
