BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:quin-event-191166@thequinhouse.com
DTSTAMP:20260709T160000Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260709T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260709T180000
SUMMARY:Meet the Maker: Berene Sauls of Tesselaarsdal Wines
LOCATION:The Muse
DESCRIPTION:Category: Food & Beverage\nPrice: Free / Included\nStatus: unli
 mited\nEvent URL: https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/191166\n\nJoin u
 s for an evening of wine\, storytelling\, and discovery as we welcome Bere
 ne Sauls\, founder and winemaker of Tesselaarsdal Wines\, for an intimate 
 reception-style Meet the Maker.\n\nBorn in the historic South African vill
 age of Tesselaarsdal and inspired by its remarkable legacy\, Berene has em
 erged as one of the country's most compelling voices in modern winemaking.
  Her journey—from working behind the scenes at the acclaimed Hamilton Ru
 ssell Vineyards to launching her own label in 2015—has been guided by a 
 commitment to honoring place\, heritage\, and the transformative power of 
 opportunity.\n\nThroughout the evening\, members will enjoy a guided tasti
 ng of two vintages each of Tesselaarsdal Chardonnay and Pinot Noir\, explo
 ring the distinctive terroir of the Hemel-en-Aarde Ridge and the stories w
 oven into every bottle. As Berene shares her experiences as a pioneering f
 emale winemaker and entrepreneur\, guests will gain a deeper appreciation 
 for the people\, history\, and landscape shaping one of South Africa's mos
 t exciting wine regions.\n\n*This event is complimenary and reserved for m
 embers only. Complimentary light bites and refreshments will be served.
URL:https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/191166
CATEGORIES:Food & Beverage
END:VEVENT
