DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260719T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260719T170000
SUMMARY:World Cup Watch Party: The Championship Final 
LOCATION:The Pub
DESCRIPTION:Category: Sports & Games\nPrice: Free / Included\nStatus: Avail
 able\nEvent URL: https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/189619\n\nAll eye
 s on the pitch for the World Cup Championship match. Settle in with the be
