DESCRIPTION:Category: Member Mixer\nPrice: $100.00 per person\nAvailability
 : 15 spots left\nStatus: Available\nEvent URL: https://members.thequinhous
 e.com/events/194060\n\nContinuing the "Curated Connections" extension of t
 he Serendipity series\, join us for dinner convening members who study\, p
 reserve\, teach\, or simply delight in history. From historians\, educator
 s\, archivists\, curators\, and authors to lifelong learners and passionat
 e history enthusiasts\, this month's shared interest will inspire engaging
  conversation as you engage with fellow members through conversations insp
 ired by the people\, places\, and pivotal moments that have shaped our wor
 ld. \n\nCurious? Set against the backdrop of a thoughtfully curated three-
 course dinner with expertly paired wines\, this unique experience invites 
 members to connect through curated conversation prompts designed to spark 
 engaging dialogue. Enjoy the perfect blend of stimulating discussion\, exc
 eptional company\, and a menu crafted to delight the senses.\n\n*Tickets a
