SUMMARY:Private Screening: "The Odyssey" 
LOCATION:Offsite: Alamo Drafthouse Seaport
DESCRIPTION:Category: The Arts\nPrice: Free\nAvailability: 80 spots left\nS
 tatus: futureSale\nEvent URL: https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/1945
 88\n\n6:00PM Doors Open\, 6:30PM - 9:30PM Screening\nJoin us for a ‘Quin
 -exclusive private screening of Christopher Nolan’s highly anticipated a
 daptation of The Odyssey.\n\nA sweeping mythological epic inspired by Home
 r's timeless poem\, The Odyssey stars Matt Damon as Odysseus\, the legenda
 ry King of Ithaca. The film chronicles his perilous decade-long journey ho
 me following the Trojan War\, where he encounters mythical creatures\, ven
 geful gods\, and extraordinary trials in his relentless quest to reunite w
 ith his wife\, Penelope. An evening of epic storytelling awaits...\n\n*Thi
 s event is complimentary and reserved for members\, plus one registered gu
 est. Tableside food and beverage service is available in the theater.
