BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:quin-event-192824@thequinhouse.com
DTSTAMP:20260725T160000Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260725T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260725T173000
SUMMARY:An Evening with Martini Master Alessandro Palazzi
LOCATION:The Reading Room
DESCRIPTION:Category: Food & Beverage\nPrice: Free / Included\nStatus: Wait
 list Only\nEvent URL: https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/192824\n\nTh
 ere are bartenders\, and then there are bartenders whose names have become
  synonymous with an institution. Alessandro Palazzi belongs firmly in the 
 latter category. The celebrated Italian mixologist has spent years shaping
  the cocktail culture of London's legendary Duke's Bar\, where his meticul
 ous approach to hospitality and his famously cold martinis have earned him
  a devoted international following.\n\nKnown for his effortless charm\, en
 cyclopedic knowledge of spirits\, and flair for storytelling\, Alessandro 
 has elevated the martini from a simple cocktail to a memorable ritual. His
  tableside preparation has become one of London's most sought-after experi
 ences\, drawing discerning travelers\, industry leaders\, and cocktail ent
 husiasts from around the world.\n\nThe 'Quin House is delighted to welcome
  Alessandro for a rare Boston appearance on Saturday\, July 18th and again
 \, on Saturday July 25th. Members will have the opportunity to learn first
 hand what separates a good cocktail from a truly exceptional one during an
  intimate masterclass covering technique\, history\, and the finer points 
 of martini-making\, presented in partnership with Procera Gin\, the award-
 winning Nairobi-based spirit crafted with fresh African juniper and celebr
 ated for redefining luxury gin through exceptional African botanicals and 
 craftsmanship.\n\nFollowing this class\, Alessandro will take over The Rea
 ding Room for the evening\, where all members can enjoy the comforts of th
 e Reading Room and martinis crafted by one of the hospitality world's most
  respected figures.\n\n*This event is offered at $100 per member and is re
 served for members only. Cancellations made within 48 hours of the event\,
  or failure to attend\, will result in a full charge. Light bites and refr
 eshments will be served.
URL:https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/192824
CATEGORIES:Food & Beverage
END:VEVENT
